        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_09",
      "hash64": "964B8F9853F50065",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! Si es que estaba cantado...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_10",
      "hash64": "964EFC9853F7EF73",
      "text": "La dificultad de los gimnasios aumenta que no\\nveas al pasar el ecuador del recorrido, ¿sabes?\\r\\n¡Avisad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa quedas![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "0B8703B70EFDCD88",
      "text": "En eso tiene toda la razón. Estadísticamente\\nhablando, es justo en este punto donde\\r\\nabandonan la mayoría de los Entrenadores.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_11",
      "hash64": "964EFB9853F7EDC0",
      "text": "Pero tú no eres de es[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oas, ¿a que no?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "champ_0080_ground_12",
      "hash64": "964EFE9853F7F2D9",
      "text": "Ya nos veremos las caras cuando te presentes al\\nexamen de campeonato, ¿okey?\\c\\nVenga, y ahora, ¡a ventilarte todos los gimnasios\\nque te quedan![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "champ_0080_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "0B8704B70EFDCF3B",
      "text": "Por mi parte, te deseo la mejor de las suertes.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
